Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有182名病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have 182 patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数病人样貌相当的畸形恐怖 这是近亲交配与繁殖必然的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most are horribly deformed, due to inbreeding and birth defects.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,C区域 安全指数相当高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ward "C" is high security.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.23,0:00:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个病人在这里都应该得到我们的尊重 对别人或对自己都是非常危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each patient in here should be considered dangerous or a danger to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一个人能通过这道门进出\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can get in or out without first passing through this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果发生火灾 我们可以打开所有的小房间逃生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can open all the cells at once in case of fire…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是每次打开门都要遵守一项协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the protocol is one cell open at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.95,0:00:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气 老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.59,0:01:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你在想什么 但我们必须检查他们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're thinking. But we have to do this for their own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可不是监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有可能的话 我们希望病人可以完全的康复\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hope to rehabilitate the patients if at all possible…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且希望他们可以重返社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have them rejoin the general population.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.10,0:01:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在所有小房间都打开之前 你必须有一个秩序…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before any cell is opened, you must have an orderly…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比！鲍比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby! Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.57,0:01:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.54,0:01:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？ - 还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真让我感到惊讶 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just surprised me. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该越过黄线到处闲逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't wander past the yellow lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能够并且会抓住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can and will grab you from their cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.89,0:01:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是希利克兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the Hilliker brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称他们“希利克太太”因为当我们找到他们的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call them that because Mrs. Hilliker found them in the woods…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正站在尸体的身上在啃食 我们认为那是他们的双亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}standing over the partially eaten remains of what we think were their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,非婚生子女非常的漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the little bastards are smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以相当肯定的说 医院里的大多数病人都相当的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely the most dangerous patients in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.17,0:01:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都只是孩子 大多数的危险？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just kids. And the most dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.81,0:01:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 请相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.31,0:01:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中最年轻的一个 用牙齿把自己的手指一点点的啃掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The youngest one, the one sucking on the stump of his hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧？ - 他已经啃掉另外的两个手指了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - He chewed off his other two fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.38,0:02:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从来没有找他们 我们觉得他会把他们都吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never found them. We think he ate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,中间的那个孩子 他拿叉子把自己的棕色的眼睛捅下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The middle child. He poked out his own eye with a fork.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.42,0:02:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且 在护士的面前吃掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ate it right in front of a nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个带着面具的那个大男孩呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the large boy with the mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一排异常巨大的牙齿 他在墙上把自己的牙齿磨的非常尖利\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has abnormally large teeth, which he was sharpening on the stone walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在他又咬了几个看护者之后 我们给他戴上了面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}We put the mask on him after he bit several orderlies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,磨尖牙齿？他怎么能忍受这样的疼痛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharpening? How can he tolerate the pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些孩子们最入迷的就是这些事情 他们不会感觉到疼痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the fascinating thing about these children. They can't feel pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有先天性痛觉丧失的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have an advanced form of congenital analgesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.45,0:02:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 极端罕见 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's extremely rare. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在同质社会这样的情形更普遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's more prevalent in homogeneous societies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.69,0:02:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 类似于西佛尼吉亚州近亲繁殖群落 - 正解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like the inbred communities of West Virginia. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.42,0:02:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以聊天吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can they talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只能咕噜咕噜的说话 用手势表达 那是他们的语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just grunts and gestures. It's their own language.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦进入他们的房间 你就绝对无法出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never turn your back on them or their cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我冒犯 医生 但这些都超出你的治疗方法之外 音乐舞台剧还是其他别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, Doctor. But these are beyond your kind of therapy. Musical or otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢和他们一起工作 赖安医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to work with them, Dr. Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许等一会可以吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe after a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们不安全的玩呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we play it safe for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.15,0:03:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我要让你在医院里休息下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'll show you the rest of the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.85,0:03:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 让我离开这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.81,0:04:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里 过来 给我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Get in here. Get me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 让我出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 护卫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！哦 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你让我走的话 我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you if you just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.93,0:07:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.63,0:07:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天 哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 拜托 别这样对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please. Don't do this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,男孩们 你不需要这样对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, you don't need to do this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你！天啊 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! God, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh! Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:10.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《致命弯道4：血腥起源》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.01,0:11:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 我的天！ - 你喜欢那样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! - You like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 是的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:11:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.27,0:12:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些野生荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are a bunch of slut monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没听见敲门？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard of knocking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特都走了 凯尔和克莱尔大概在山上等着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Porter has already left. Kyle and Claire are probably waiting for us on the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车在五分钟内会离开 不管你们这些家伙在还是不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}My car leaves in five minutes whether you guys wanna be in it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不来放松一会呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just relax and jump underneath the covers for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得布丽姬特会非常的赏识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think Bridget would appreciate that very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.59,0:13:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会介意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也不会介意 - 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't mind either. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开个玩笑 - 五分钟 小兔子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just kidding. - Five minutes, you rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.11,0:13:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么今年我们不去埃斯佩？波特的小木屋有够烂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't we going to Aspen this year? Porter's cabin sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.18,0:13:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我的爸爸失去了他退休的机会 所以不得不卖掉他的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because my dad lost his retirement and had to sell the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.25,0:13:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 是啊 当他被找到的时候 你应该已经看见他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah, you should have seen him when he found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他想从桥上跳下去 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was gonna jump off a bridge. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.02,0:13:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！ - 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.76,0:13:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！ - 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.53,0:13:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Porter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他直接回小木屋 让身体发汗去了 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He went on ahead to get the cabin warmed up. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.26,0:13:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定是病了或者怎么样了 因为波特经常随身带一个热水袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be sick or something 'cause usually Porter's a douche bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是对你 - 我知道 那跟什么有关？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Only to you. - I know. What's that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我不知道 也许这就是你让我过来的原因？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I don't know. Maybe it's because you keep making passes at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的不可靠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's that insecure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是有什么事想告诉我？肯尼娅？我在这里是因为我的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something you want to tell me, Kenia? I'm here for a sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 滚开 滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, fuck off. Fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你好么？ - 嘿 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. How you doing? - Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的交通工具 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is my ride. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.38,0:14:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我太兴奋了 不是么？ - 我是如此的兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am so excited. Aren't you? - I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.49,0:14:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 兄弟 抱歉来晚了 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, guys. Sorry we're late. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都是丹尼尔的错 - 这条路可真糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daniel's fault. - The roads were bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁开的车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who's driving?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.33,0:14:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车就像个小女孩 我想开快车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drive like a girl. I want to go fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.87,0:14:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 真的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Real nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那、你想搭着我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're gonna wanna ride with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 你们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.51,0:14:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 凯尔？我刚听到电台新闻报告 会有一个巨大的风暴经过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kyle? I heard on the radio there's a huge storm blowing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 也许我们该等等再走？还是等明天再说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think maybe we wait? Do this tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.15,0:14:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的 公主 一小时内我们会一直待在小木屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be okay, princess. We'll be at the cabin in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 开始打吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好极了！ - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.39,0:14:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那些车怎么样？开到公园应该没事吧？ - 哦 我的天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the cars? Are we okay to park here? - Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西 丹尼尔 你还担心一切吗？他们都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Daniel. You got to worry about everything? They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.93,0:15:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.93,0:15:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说真的？丹尼尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, Daniel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干嘛？ - 看看丹尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Check out Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是么？安全第一！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Safety first!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意看到你在雪地车上掉下来的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to see you laughing when you fall off your snowmobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊…哦！ - 好的 出发吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh. - All right. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出发！ - 快出发吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! - Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up close!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 女士们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进！\N{\fnArial\fs30}gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你迷路了 - 不 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're lost. - No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就承认了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴 该死的 这里被冻住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiot. It's frickin' freezing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了一个半小时 肯定又降了20度\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have dropped 20 degrees in the last half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.16,0:17:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,离黎明还有一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got an hour of daylight left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的风暴随时会刮过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a huge storm blowing in any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持点风度 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me a minute to get my bearings, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.03,0:17:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿？嘿！ - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey? Hey! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.07,0:17:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该开到左边那个斜坡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be going left up there over that hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我曾和波特去那个小木屋一百次 是在右边 我很肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I've been to the cabin a hundred times with Porter. It's right. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.91,0:17:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该开到不远处的半山腰那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get over that far ridge over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们就去那里 我也快冻死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Then let's go. I'm freezing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.35,0:17:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 来吧 - 来吧 兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Come on! - Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.76,0:17:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开错了方向 我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's making a wrong turn. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:18:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 兄弟们！我觉得我开反了方向！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, guys! I guess I got turned around!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.11,0:18:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不能很快找到避难所 我们都会冻死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't find some shelter soon, we're gonna freeze to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我们要准确的原路开回去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we go back the exact same way we came!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.38,0:18:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 那倒不算是一个糟糕的主意 我们开回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's not a bad idea. Let's turn around…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.55,0:18:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,掉头下山 沿着你在雪中来时的车的轨迹开回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}head back down the mountain, and follow your tracks in the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么轨迹？雪中的车的轨迹都被刮走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What tracks? They've been blown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - What's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个巨大的、黑色的风暴沿着山腰刮过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That huge, dark shape along the side of the ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为那是个建筑物！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's a building!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的…啊！我们得救了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frickin'-A! We're saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.93,0:18:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧！ 快来！ - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! Let's go! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快冻死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.45,0:19:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别滑到了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't slip!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢天谢地 - 布丽姬特 我可以吻你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank God. - Bridget, I could kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.55,0:19:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 门是打开的 进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ohh. - It's open. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你想要你的滑雪板装备吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you want your ski gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.09,0:19:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,离它远点 我会拿回我的背包 它也被冻住了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it. I've got my bag, and it's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦！ - 我快冻死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ohh! - I'm freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这到底是什么地方？ - 或许是一间旧医院？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this place? - An old hospital maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.25,0:19:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 看起来就像是在晚上参观一样 - 棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, it looks like we're visiting for the night. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以进去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死的 - 为什么这里如此温暖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy crap. - Why is it so warm in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.74,0:20:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这里有管理员或者门警什么的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's a janitor here or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.71,0:20:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们大概在烧锅炉所以管道才不会结冰的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They probably keep the boiler going so the pipes won't freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.31,0:20:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然能找到这个地方来 你可真是走运啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really lucky this place was here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真让人毛骨悚然 - 哦 这里落满了灰尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Creepy. - Oh, it's dusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到处都是灰 - 好恶心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gross. - It's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.25,0:20:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我高兴的只是我们进来了 - 那你找到了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just glad we're inside. - Ew! Did you find that in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.89,0:20:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到了 - 别碰它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.09,0:20:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真吓人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's so creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找到电灯开关了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you guys find something to burn?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.26,0:20:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些木制品 或是家具什么的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrap wood or furniture? Something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.16,0:20:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 我们看见了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. We're on it. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波特呢？ - 他就像我们期待的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about Porter? - He's going to be expecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉不觉得 他在这个温度下会出去的 不是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think he'd go out in this weather, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不 波特太聪明了才不会那样做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Porter's way too smart for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许应该给他打个电话 让他知道我们很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should give him a call. Let him know we're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.25,0:20:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.82,0:20:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手机服务中断了 真是奇怪 你们的手机有信号吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My freaking cell service sucks. Does anyone have a signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.22,0:21:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看 没信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么都没有 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼娅 波特是个聪明的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenia, Porter's a really smart guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该知道这种天气我们不会外出\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna know we wouldn't go out in this weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.23,0:21:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说波特变聪明了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about Porter being smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说哪个波特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which Porter is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.37,0:21:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 他是那群混蛋中比凯尔更聪明一点的家伙 谁让我们迷路了 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's a hell of a lot smarter than Kyle, who got us lost. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没说凯尔也聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say Kyle was smart either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特现在或许在温暖舒适的房间正快活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Porter's probably nice and toasty right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.05,0:21:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谁准备了小型烧烤？是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Who's up for a weenie roast? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你？还是你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.53,0:21:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 过来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scooch, scooch, scooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 各位 我只是想对各位说声抱歉 我犯了个错误 不该去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys. I just want to say sorry for the mix-up out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.42,0:22:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道事情也许变得很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know things could have turned out really bad…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.73,0:22:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我高兴的是我们都还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm glad we're all okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.83,0:22:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心了 兄弟 每个人都可能会发生这种事情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it, dude. It could have happened to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错 我们都很好 早上我们就回到小木屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine. We're all fine. We'll go to the cabin in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.60,0:22:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 到那个时候天气就会变晴朗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the weather should be clear by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.50,0:22:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先找些休息的地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just try to get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.10,0:22:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门！你难道看不见这个地方吗？真是令人难以置信！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way! Have you seen this place? It's fucking fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们检查下 做一次小小的探险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's check it out. Do a little exploring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.31,0:22:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,非法入侵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trespassing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.32,0:22:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 丹尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.29,0:22:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啦 好啦 我和你一起去 - 耶 我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. All right. I'll go with you. - Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.86,0:22:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们女孩子呆在一起可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You girls gonna be okay alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.66,0:22:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别再走丢了 - 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't get lost again. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你期望她们会为我们做一顿晚餐吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You expect us girls to cook dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.33,0:22:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,热狗啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hot dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.94,0:22:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你们这些女孩可以做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you ladies can handle that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.17,0:23:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 也许我不想做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.31,0:23:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 布丽姬特 你不做热狗是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, Bridget. You don't do hot dogs, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 文森特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.18,0:23:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 我和你一起去 - 那 我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. I'll go with you. - Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.59,0:23:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等 我也要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait up. I'm coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.16,0:23:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那\N{\fnArial\fs30}check up.
