Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.49,0:24:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在忙着治疗我的病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm busy with my patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.13,0:24:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿！离我远点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Get away from me!
