Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.01,0:25:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,疗养院是从医院其他的隔离病人中选出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sanatorium is a hospital that isolates sick people from the rest of the population.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.25,0:25:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人到底发生了什么事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was wrong with these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.48,0:25:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
