Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.65,0:32:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在开心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.21,0:32:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 太谢谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.65,0:32:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们刚才找到了真正酷的东西 过来一起玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, let's go have some fun 'cause I found some really cool shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.99,0:32:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.46,0:32:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.06,0:33:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走！我们走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.60,0:33:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,获胜者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The winner!\N? And here he comes again?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.94,0:33:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 走 走 走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, go, go, go!\N? Ohh, ohh, ohh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.05,0:33:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,向右转！ 向右转！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn right! Turn right!\N? He never had no mercy for me??
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.49,0:33:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.86,0:33:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做到了 我做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.87,0:34:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方太令人惊讶了 这些怪胎竟然还有观众席\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is amazing. The freaks had their own auditorium.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.84,0:34:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想象这些家伙在台上表演吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine those guys up there putting on their own play?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.32,0:34:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这称为“怪胎秀”\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gives a whole new meaning to the term freak show.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.08,0:34:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我敢打赌每个人都是大象人的变种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I bet everyone was a variation of the Elephant Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.59,0:34:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 他们观看的影片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, they watched movies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.69,0:34:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 让我看看那个 - 好的 观影时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, let me see that. - Okay, movie time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.60,0:34:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位开始兴奋了吗？ - 当然！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall I fire it up? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.90,0:34:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想要爆米花？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's up for popcorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.07,0:34:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.57,0:35:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是很可怕而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.08,0:35:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's kind of sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.78,0:35:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道他们发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.55,0:35:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.49,0:35:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.86,0:35:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得现在这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember this place now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.46,0:35:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我还是一个小女孩的时候 我弟弟经常在这里给我讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother used to scare the shit out of me when I was a little girl…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.19,0:35:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些用来吓我的乡巴佬的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}with stories about the hillbillies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.06,0:35:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么故事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.73,0:35:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说这里曾经有一群西佛尼吉亚州的乡巴佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said there was a bunch of inbred West Virginia hillbillies…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.30,0:35:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直居住在这里 当有人被围困返回的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}that got rounded up way back when…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.97,0:35:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会回来 把他们都锁在这个医院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and locked up in this old hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.34,0:35:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 我的天 - 他们畸形并不是因为其他的原因所导致的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - They're deformed 'cause they kept on screwing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.31,0:35:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 他们并不是一起生活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that's not all they did to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.48,0:35:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么原因？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.12,0:35:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 他们互相啃食彼此 食人者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said they ate each other. Cannibals.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.05,0:35:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说真的？ - 这真是一派胡言\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you serious? - That's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.62,0:36:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是 就是 - 那只是都市传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, right. - That's an urban legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.52,0:36:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他每次开车穿越“绿蔷薇州”的时候 都会告诉我这个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd tell me the stories every time we drove through Greenbrier County.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.76,0:36:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,演出结束 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show's over, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.13,0:36:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 我不想知道你们想干嘛 但是我想睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - I don't know about you guys, but I am going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.97,0:36:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lauren?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.17,0:36:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 詹娜？一起走吗？ - 好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Jenna? Wanna go? - That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.07,0:36:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 做些噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, for some nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.14,0:36:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 宝贝 就寝时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, baby. Bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.05,0:36:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 谁想在早上和我一起跑楼梯 有人一起吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, who wants to run the stairs with me in the morning? Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.02,0:36:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,早起锻炼身体？我想我们要睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake and exercise? I think I'll sleep in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.42,0:36:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.96,0:36:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.67,0:36:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不着 我去探险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sleep. I'm gonna go explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.23,0:36:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 别和别人一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Don't go fucking with anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.47,0:36:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们睡熟了 这也不太酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're asleep and it's so not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.74,0:36:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.68,0:36:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.57,0:38:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你！谁在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you! Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.01,0:38:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别想玩我 兄弟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better not be playing with me, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.32,0:38:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要揍了你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll beat the shit out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.59,0:38:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Porter, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.70,0:38:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特 你什么时候到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Porter, when did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.70,0:39:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 你想吓我是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit. You scared the hell out of me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.37,0:39:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很不错 不是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is great, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.54,0:39:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你在干嘛？我们回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what are you doing? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.85,0:39:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你睡着了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, are you asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.69,0:39:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈的该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.45,0:40:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.72,0:40:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 我们差不多走出杂草堆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. We're almost out of weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.99,0:40:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 是你昨晚在这里抽烟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's 'cause you smoked it all last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.59,0:40:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的衬衣呢？ - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's my shirt? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.66,0:40:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这里 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.33,0:40:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.14,0:40:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你看到文森特了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, have you seen Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.47,0:40:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没看见 - 没看见？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.04,0:40:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他昨晚探险去了 我也找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went exploring last night, and I can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.95,0:41:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从昨晚起就还没看见他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't seen him since last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.51,0:41:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.12,0:41:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恩 他应该去别的地方了吧 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, he's got to be around here somewhere. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.55,0:41:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会帮你看看的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll help you look. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.76,0:41:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方太大了 他可以在任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is so huge. He could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.86,0:41:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.13,0:41:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 几位 你们看到文森特了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, have you seen Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.96,0:41:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 昨晚就没看到了 没看到 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not since last night, no. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.60,0:41:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有？哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.07,0:41:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 额…我们找找文森特吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're, uh… We're looking for Vincent.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.14,0:41:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.77,0:41:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是不担心 各位 我们又没走完所有的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't worry about it, guys. We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.87,0:41:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过那边了吗？那里可是在下大雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen it out there? It's snowing like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.91,0:41:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 莎拉 你看见文森特了吗？ - 看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Sara, have you seen Vincent? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.85,0:41:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的么？他在哪儿？ - 我昨晚看见他在偷窥我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? Where is he? - I saw him last night doing his peeping tom bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.18,0:41:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在看我和布丽姬特\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was watching me and Bridget.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.49,0:41:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那今天早上呢？ - 不 我还没看见他 我一小时前在运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about this morning? - No, I haven't seen him. I've been running for the last hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.52,0:41:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开动了 每个人都有早餐吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's eat. Breakfast anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.46,0:41:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都吃饱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll grab our stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.09,0:41:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 文森特怎么了？ - 他要出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about Vincent? - He'll show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.83,0:41:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你们都下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you guys down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.66,0:41:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 见鬼去吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously. Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.14,0:41:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你他妈的要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where did all our shit go?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.44,0:42:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森特或许我们去食堂用餐就会见到了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent's probably trying to mess with us, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.21,0:42:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 丢些木头在火上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it. Just throw some wood on the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.61,0:42:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 外边很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. It's bad out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.58,0:42:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你觉得我们应该等风暴过后再走么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, do you think we should wait for the storm to blow over?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.65,0:42:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你看 我说我们应该打包收拾好 找到文森特 然后离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Look, I say we pack up, we find Vincent, and we get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.79,0:42:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们分两组进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Let's split up into two groups though.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.92,0:42:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔 你带着布丽姬特 莎拉 还有劳伦 去看看上面的楼层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel, you take Bridget, Sara and Lauren and check the upper floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.39,0:42:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人和我走 我们去看看一楼和地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone else come with me. We'll check the first floor and the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.46,0:42:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一个半小时后在观众席见\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll meet up in the auditorium in half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.30,0:42:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我还没有吃完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… I'm not done eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.80,0:42:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 快点 哎呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle, come on. Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.17,0:42:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有人觉得我们的东西消失的很奇怪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone not think it's weird our stuff is gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.54,0:42:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,几位 我们会比预期更早的发现他 然后尽快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, the sooner we find him, the quicker we can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.98,0:42:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.21,0:42:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.01,0:42:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是公主 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a princess. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.82,0:42:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得很好笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.89,0:42:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 等等！是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.49,0:42:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.86,0:42:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 很肯定他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He's dead for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.20,0:42:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.63,0:42:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 文森特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.73,0:43:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森特 我们找到食物啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent, we've got food!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.63,0:43:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 文森特！ - 我再也不喜欢这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vince! - I really don't like this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.94,0:43:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.71,0:43:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那些是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.39,0:43:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我们一定要查查看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're definitely checking this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.04,0:43:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你不用按照顺序…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I guess if you didn't follow the program…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.98,0:43:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们就会把你这些切成薄片 切成一小块一小块的… - 离开这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- they had some serious slice and dice… - Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.62,0:43:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找文森特 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for Vincent, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.55,0:43:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得 - 是的 我们走吧 快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Yeah. Let's go. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.46,0:43:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别做傻事 - 我们离开这吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quit goofing around. - Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.60,0:44:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,C区域 打开门 我们检查下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ward "C." Open the door. Let's check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.18,0:44:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们像是关动物一样关着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They locked them up like animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.98,0:44:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看起来像是动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look like animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.98,0:44:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.72,0:44:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.25,0:44:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像是护士站\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like a nurse's station.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.62,0:44:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是这里遗留了药品的话 文森特肯定会查看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent definitely would have checked to see if there were any drugs left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.43,0:44:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.37,0:44:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.40,0:44:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.07,0:44:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 呆在这里 好吗？我去看看后就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, stay here, okay? I'm gonna check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.21,0:44:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是文森特的血吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think it's Vincent's?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.72,0:45:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 我是说 他…他…砍伤了什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I mean, he-he… he could have cut himself on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.62,0:45:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.13,0:45:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我们每次经过走廊 我们会看到更多的血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I say we each take a hallway. We can cover more ground that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.50,0:45:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.80,0:45:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.10,0:45:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猜我们走这边 - 我猜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I guess we're going this way. - I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.46,0:45:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vincent?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.43,0:47:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的开始担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really starting to get worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.30,0:47:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会出现的 - 我确信他只是在哪里睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'll show up. - I'm sure he just fell asleep somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.13,0:47:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他昨晚抽了很多烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He smoked pretty heavy last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.87,0:47:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大概喝醉了酒 在迷迷糊糊中不知道走到哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably stoned right now, in a corner having a bad trip somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.54,0:47:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.44,0:47:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到什么了吗？ - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you guys find anything? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.34,0:47:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 一小滩血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - A small amount of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.31,0:47:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不能独自一人呆在这里 - 你那么说是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are not alone here. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.61,0:47:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想要干掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody is fucking with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.32,0:47:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 我想尽快的出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I wanna get the hell outta here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.39,0:47:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想把我们都杀死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.99,0:47:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个看起来想是波特的夹克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks like Porter's jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.83,0:47:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是波特的夹克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is Porter's jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.49,0:48:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.92,0:48:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.70,0:48:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔！克莱尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire! Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.17,0:48:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！克莱尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.84,0:48:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看了！坚持住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look up! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.88,0:48:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.61,0:48:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 坚持住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.95,0:48:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊！克莱尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.93,0:49:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.56,0:49:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的门被锁住了！锁起来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fucking door's locked! It's locked!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.54,0:49:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们 快过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.43,0:49:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.24,0:49:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的上帝！该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.94,0:49:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 启动不了了！ - 我也是！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It won't start! - Neither will mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.52,0:49:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.35,0:49:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们弄坏了电源线\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've stripped the spark plug wires.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.49,0:50:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的也是 - 他们弄坏了雪上摩托！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mine too. - They sabotaged the fucking snowmobiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.53,0:50:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.26,0:50:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能在这场风暴中漫步的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't last on foot in this storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.33,0:50:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甚至没穿那该死的夹克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even have fucking jackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.83,0:50:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,按我说 我们应该回去想出保护我们自己的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we go back inside and figure out a way to defend ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.00,0:50:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁去与那些畸形人在一起？ - 我弟弟告诉我 他们是食人者乡巴佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the fuck are they? - The cannibal hillbillies my brother told me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.97,0:50:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁要回去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.11,0:50:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？ - 我去找救兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I'm going for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.04,0:50:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你会冻死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, you'll freeze to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.01,0:50:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是最强壮的滑雪者 我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the strongest skier. I've got the gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.15,0:50:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会滑下山 然后找警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make it down the mountain, and I'll call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.88,0:50:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 我真的觉得你不该这样行动 - 我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Baby, I really don't think you should go. - I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.02,0:50:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是没人可以做到 就让劳伦去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anybody can make it, it's Lauren.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.56,0:50:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来找你的 好吗？我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come back for you. Okay? I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.56,0:50:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.46,0:50:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.20,0:50:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快会看见你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.39,0:51:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.89,0:51:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 莎拉 拜托！我们不能返回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Sara, please! We can't go back in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.36,0:51:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须回去 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.93,0:51:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间医生的办公室…有坚固的门并且还有一把锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor's office…It has a sturdy door and a lock on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.10,0:51:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 进来是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it's right near the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.17,0:51:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能那样做 - 我们可以冻死 或者互相打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't do that. - We either freeze to death or we fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.04,0:51:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.65,0:51:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.59,0:51:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要找到些武器 - 我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to get weapons. - I've got mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.49,0:51:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也需要这些武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of us need them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.16,0:51:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了 我们要离开这该死的地方！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy. We need to get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.73,0:51:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴间歇期间 我们有事情要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as the storm breaks, that's what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.27,0:51:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,几位？过来 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys? Guys, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.33,0:51:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个在阳台上攻击克莱尔的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the guy that attacked Claire on the balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.44,0:52:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们极端暴力 无论是心理上 身体上都非常的畸形\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says they were violent, mentally, physically deformed…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.21,0:52:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我们展示了同类相食的种种可怕的场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}and showed signs of cannibalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.58,0:52:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是怎么幸存在这个世界上的？ - 他们是猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did they survive out here? - They're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.15,0:52:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们开始猎食我们了 他们会吃掉任何的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now they're hunting us. They'll eat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.88,0:52:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！他们大概现在已经吃到波特的排骨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! They probably turned Porter into porterhouse by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.05,0:52:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闭嘴吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.79,0:52:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}The basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.69,0:52:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 笼子里有东西 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That cage thing. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.33,0:52:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.86,0:52:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个笼子下面有很多的小刀和锯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That cage downstairs with all the knives and saws in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.87,0:53:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们应该待在一起 - 不 我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should all go together. - No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.14,0:53:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们待在这里直到有人来帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just stay here until help comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.84,0:53:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 你的妞待在这怎么样 丹尼尔和我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, how about you girls stay here. Daniel and I will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.87,0:53:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你锁好门待在我们后面 - 哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You lock the door behind us. - Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.41,0:53:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你愿意陪着我 - 我们需要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks for volunteering me. - We need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.38,0:53:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我只是觉得我们应该待在一起 多给他们点信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just think we should all go together. Strength in numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.11,0:53:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是想临阵退缩吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seriously gonna chicken out on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.85,0:53:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.45,0:53:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 我去吧 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. I'll go. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.32,0:53:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和你一起走 - 不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go with you. - No. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.59,0:53:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事的 你和肯尼娅待在一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine. You stay here with Kenia.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.36,0:53:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 请别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara, please. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.36,0:53:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道之前我马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.23,0:53:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.84,0:53:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 各位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.24,0:53:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready as I'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.94,0:53:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁好门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.80,0:54:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不是非常的远 从左面还是可以上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not much further. It's just up here to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.30,0:54:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.70,0:54:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.27,0:54:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们打死他 - 他手里拿着一把斧头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's just fight him! - He's got a fucking ax!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.24,0:54:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just run!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.44,0:54:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.35,0:54:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他来了 我们杀了他 - 杀死那些畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's coming. Let's kill him. - Kill the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.29,0:55:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔？是你么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle? Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.76,0:55:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉？丹尼尔？是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara? Daniel? Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.18,0:55:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.45,0:55:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会让你走的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.65,0:55:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.66,0:55:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走开 你这个不要脸的家伙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away, you motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.21,0:55:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going away.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.78,0:56:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别打开门 - 我们去找其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't open the door. - We gotta get back to the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.52,0:56:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他们的该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.09,0:56:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他敢回来 我们就会杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he comes back, we'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.62,0:56:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.34,0:56:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.11,0:56:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有危险 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clear. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.12,0:56:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.08,0:57:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我走 你这个该死的怪胎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go, you fucking freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.46,0:57:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼娅？是我们 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenia? It's us. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.83,0:57:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死的 发生什么事了？ - 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck happened? - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.70,0:57:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门！开门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.27,0:57:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.84,0:57:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Daniel?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.40,0:57:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我后边\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.91,0:57:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们一定要回去找他 - 不 不 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to go back for him. - No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.11,0:57:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,去外边太危险了 他们应该找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dangerous out there. They could have got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.38,0:57:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门 如果他在后边的话 我们会看见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door. We'll just see if he fell behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.22,0:57:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔？丹尼尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel? Daniel?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.82,0:57:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.86,0:57:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们必须想出该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we gotta figure out what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.60,0:58:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不！哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.82,0:58:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的上帝！天 快来人救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! God, somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.29,0:58:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.12,0:58:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刺伤了他的手臂 然后离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stabbed him in the arm, and he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.02,0:58:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘！你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.43,0:58:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是丹尼尔 我们必须帮帮他 我们还等什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Daniel. We've gotta help him. What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.06,0:58:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.53,0:58:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.64,0:58:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,救…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.14,0:58:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大概已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.21,0:58:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他没有死 我可不想离开他自己走掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna leave him out there if he isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.35,0:58:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听！我们必须有一个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen! We have to have a plan…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.15,0:58:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能够活着离开这儿 那么我有一个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we're gonna get out of here alive, and I have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.62,0:58:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括离开丹尼尔让他死掉的计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it include leaving Daniel to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.49,0:58:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们已经抓到了丹尼尔 布丽姬特也许是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they have Daniel already, Bridget's probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.49,0:58:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果他藏起来了的话 我们需要计划一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he's hiding, we need to be organized…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.43,0:59:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们计划俘虏这些怪胎 - 怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and have a plan to capture these freaks. - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.86,0:59:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！哦！哦！不 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaah! Oh! Oh! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.14,0:59:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.48,0:59:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是他 我们走 - 不！那可能是个圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's him. Let's go. - No! It could be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.68,0:59:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 那可能是个圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It could be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.08,0:59:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.82,1:00:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抓到了他 然后把他当做一个诱饵来把我们一个一个都抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have him, and he's the bait to get to the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.02,1:00:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说的对 为什么他们会让他活着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is right. Why else would they keep him alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.00,1:00:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不关心她是不是说得对 我同意凯尔个莎拉的意见 你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if she's right. I agree with Kyle and Sara, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.37,1:00:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们让他自生自灭 - 一分钟前 你可不是这样说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't leave him to die. - Just a minute ago, you said not to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.64,1:00:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那时候我在想他可能已经死了 现在我知道他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's when I thought he was dead. Now I know he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.81,1:00:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们投票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. I say we vote.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.88,1:00:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.56,1:00:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,想留在这里的 举手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who want to stay, raise your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.53,1:00:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去救克莱尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who want to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.84,1:00:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.34,1:00:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到了吗？ - 这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you got? - Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.35,1:01:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 来吧 你准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Come on. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.86,1:01:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.83,1:01:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.56,1:01:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到底在对他做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are they doing to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.14,1:01:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天！天啊 让我…让我去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! God, let me… Let me die.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.58,1:01:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 让我去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, let me die!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.03,1:01:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！等等！看看我们到什么地方来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait! Think what's down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.80,1:01:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 这是C区域？ - 厨具和房间都是C区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, the cell ward "C"? - The kitchen and cell ward "C".
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.90,1:01:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去看看 - 尽快回到我们这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go check it out. - You come back to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.94,1:01:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.26,1:02:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.99,1:03:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.62,1:03:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 让我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, let me…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.96,1:04:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 天啊 快让我去死吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. God, let me die!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.99,1:04:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 请…\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, please…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.23,1:04:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.06,1:04:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那该死的厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the fucking kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.83,1:04:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把他绑在桌子上 真让人害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They strapped him to a table. It was fucking horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.77,1:04:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.34,1:04:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们割掉丹尼尔身上的衣服 把他身上的肉切成薄片\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're stripping pieces of flesh off of Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.81,1:04:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把薄片烫熟 然后一点点的吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're boiling it in oil, and they're eating him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.71,1:04:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们活吃着他 还加上奶酪火锅大杂烩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're eating him alive like some fucked-up fondue.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.75,1:04:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.19,1:05:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有多少人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many are in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.72,1:05:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个人 有一个大家伙 还有两个臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's three. There's one big guy and two small guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.19,1:05:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹娜 你先去 你先去走廊C区域的拐角处躲着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna, you take that. You go down the hall to the juncture with Ward "C."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.06,1:05:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让他们从厨房的后门出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll force them out the back door of the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.57,1:05:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们向你走过来的时候 你就向他们扔油灯 好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they come to you, you throw the lamp. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.27,1:05:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们没得选择只能下到房间区域里来 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're gonna have no choice but to go down to the cell ward. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.81,1:05:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你准备好了吗？ - 让我们快走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you ready? - Let's fucking go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.44,1:05:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？ 走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.85,1:06:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.25,1:06:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.81,1:06:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 开始动手吧 - 等等 我们不能就这么杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. Let's do it. - Wait. We can't just kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.22,1:06:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？为什么不行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why the fuck not?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.85,1:06:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了我们的朋友 他们又想杀掉我们 还有吃掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed our friends, and they were gonna kill us and fuckin' eat us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.55,1:06:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们不是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're not them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.12,1:06:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样！嘿 你 看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck that! Hey, you. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.63,1:06:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.66,1:06:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 去你妈的混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, you motherfuckers!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.33,1:06:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想砍断你的头！你理解吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna cut your fucking hearts out! You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.27,1:06:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿别的煤油灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get the other kerosene lantern.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.93,1:06:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想要烧烤这些活着的怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna roast these fuckers alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.00,1:07:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,烤肉时间 怪胎们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for a barbecue, fuckers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.03,1:08:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 别这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle, don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.04,1:08:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们应得的报应 - 是的 他们应得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They deserve it. - Yeah, they do…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.71,1:08:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不应该这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.27,1:08:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别对自己这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.71,1:08:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个打火机给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that lighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.98,1:08:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把打火机给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the lighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.86,1:08:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们要怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What the hell are we gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.73,1:08:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找电源线 然后早上离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find the spark plug wires, and we leave in the morning…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.20,1:08:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴 也许没有风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}storm or no storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.77,1:08:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里有电源线？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the spark plug wires?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.72,1:08:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些私生子不会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bastards can't even talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.05,1:08:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就去找 一个房间一个房间去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Then we search. Room by room.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.89,1:08:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 但是有人必须监视他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. But somebody has to watch them.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.73,1:09:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.93,1:09:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想碰他们头上的头发 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't touch a fucking hair on their head. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.10,1:09:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.87,1:09:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找电线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go look for the wires.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.14,1:09:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我监视几个小时 然后再依次监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send someone back in a couple hours to relieve me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.24,1:09:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚轮班监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take shifts throughout the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.42,1:09:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.46,1:09:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你饿了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.09,1:09:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 带点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.84,1:09:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 你他妈的混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.54,1:09:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我竟然会饲养你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought I was actually gonna feed you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.04,1:09:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想杀了你们三个 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm actually gonna kill all three of you, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.35,1:09:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.55,1:09:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 我想忘了这些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna say I forgot something…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.49,1:10:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm gonna come back…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.35,1:10:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想杀了你们每一个怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna kill each and every one of you freaks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.46,1:10:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是快点睡觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.68,1:10:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里什么东西都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.08,1:10:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 这个地方太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, this place is so big…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.35,1:10:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定找不到\r\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're never gonna find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.76,1:10:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说我们找另一个房间 继续看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we pick another room and keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.72,1:10:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们需要保持精力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We need our strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.43,1:10:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们不能整晚监视的话 我们明天就会很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we look all night, we're gonna be no good for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.73,1:10:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是要是我们不能找到电源线 我们就没办法离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but if we can't find the spark plug wires we can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.13,1:10:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在黎明之前要出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm walking out of here at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.00,1:10:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看医生办公室 再到那去睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's head up to the doctor's office and bed down for the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.70,1:10:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,半夜换我来监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the next watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.67,1:12:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.94,1:12:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,该换凯尔睡一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna relieve Kyle of his shift.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.55,1:12:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.12,1:12:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will. You too.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.42,1:12:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走后你要锁好门 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to lock it after me?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.69,1:12:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.36,1:12:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.46,1:13:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.93,1:13:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.80,1:13:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.58,1:13:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这一个发电机 只有这一个发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only the generator. It's only the generator.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.62,1:13:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.47,1:14:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.04,1:14:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.61,1:14:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.25,1:14:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.56,1:14:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死！该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit! Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.16,1:14:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是肯尼娅！快来！让我进去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Kenia! Hurry! Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.46,1:14:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.50,1:14:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 来吧 - 发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Come on. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.73,1:14:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不见了 - 不见了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gone. - Gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.83,1:14:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那三个怪胎 他们不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The three freaks, they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.64,1:14:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯尔呢？ - 他也不见了 一点声音都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Kyle? - He's gone too. There's no sign of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.94,1:14:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 你觉得凯尔把他们都杀了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Do you think Kyle killed them?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.81,1:14:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不觉得 要是他杀了那些家伙的话 他就会在这里了不是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Wouldn't he be here right now if he did?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.44,1:14:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们必须从这里出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we have to get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.34,1:14:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用障碍物把这里堵起来到早上 然后我们就快点跑出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stay barricaded in until morning, and then we make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.18,1:14:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,都同意吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone agree?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.75,1:14:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 如果我们到时候都搞定了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, if we make it till then.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.66,1:15:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听到没？ - 听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you hear that? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.86,1:15:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想出去检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.43,1:15:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get too close.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.31,1:15:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是谁？ - 是其中一个小个子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is it? - It's the small one.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.62,1:15:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有武器 我们杀了他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's unarmed. Let's fucking kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.09,1:15:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很奇怪 这可能是一个圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is strange. This could be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.83,1:15:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其他两个可能在角落里 - 但如果他们不在呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The other two could be around the corner. - But what if they're not?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.13,1:15:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以杀了一个增加我们逃出去的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can kill one right now and improve our odds.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.70,1:15:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们杀了那个怪物！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's fucking kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.07,1:15:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里有四个人 他们那里却只有一个人 我们快动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are four of us, and there's one of him. Let's fucking do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.54,1:15:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.18,1:15:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.91,1:16:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 但是我们要一起行动 然后再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but we go as a group, and we come right back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.65,1:16:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你准备好了吗？ - 准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.25,1:16:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.50,1:16:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个变态去死吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fuckin' pervert, die!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.10,1:16:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死！去死 你这个混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die! Die, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.43,1:16:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不！不 求求你 不要！不 不 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! No, please, no! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.83,1:16:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他什么话都不说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't he say anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.77,1:16:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那些私生子砍掉了他的舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the bastards cut his tongue out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.04,1:17:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.89,1:17:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中了圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trapped in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.69,1:17:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了！快上楼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming! Upstairs, quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.63,1:17:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去 我们要藏进阁楼里去 走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. We'll hide in the attic. Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.79,1:17:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们居住的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where they live.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.39,1:17:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们快回来了 我们快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where they'll come back to. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.63,1:17:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 现在就离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.53,1:17:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 外套 拿些工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, coats. Grab some gear.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.20,1:18:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我不要披着这些脏衣服 - 哦 是的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm not putting those clothes on. - Oh, yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.30,1:18:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能够在这里幸存下来 - 带上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can survive in these. - Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.77,1:18:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry! - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.17,1:18:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,走下主楼 看看我们能不能找到一条出去的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head down to the main floor. See if we can find a way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.68,1:18:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到一个开着的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to find a way to lock ourselves in.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.08,1:18:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Here. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.36,1:18:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里 那应该等他们在外面的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. That should keep them out for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.29,1:18:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要找到从这里离开的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find a way to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.66,1:18:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须从窗户上爬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to climb out a window.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.66,1:18:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.37,1:18:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁栅栏 我们被干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grates. We're fucked.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.50,1:18:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会待在铁栅栏里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't all be grated.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.11,1:18:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那些畸形者进来？你确信就是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep the freaks in? You bet they all are.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.58,1:18:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 各位 过来 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, everyone. Come here. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.72,1:18:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,栅栏已经生锈了 把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grate has rusted out. Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.22,1:19:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.33,1:19:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.70,1:19:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些混蛋在门那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuckers are at the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.54,1:19:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.77,1:19:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.25,1:19:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挖了一个洞 你们跟着来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll dig a hole. You guys follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.10,1:19:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.66,1:20:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.27,1:20:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.37,1:20:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是下一个 走吧 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're next. Get going. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.92,1:20:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点走吧 我们在后面见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get going. I'll be right behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.52,1:20:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.17,1:20:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 肯尼娅！快点！快！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Kenia! Come on! Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.34,1:20:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我安全了！来吧 詹娜 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm clear! Come on, Jenna. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.44,1:20:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.52,1:21:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹娜 你能听得到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenna, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.36,1:21:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的脚踝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold my ankles.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.14,1:21:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.35,1:21:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹娜？詹娜？ - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jenna? Jenna? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.02,1:21:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！我们要走了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! We gotta get going!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.50,1:22:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！起来！我们必须快点走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on! Get up! We have to go!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.51,1:22:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！我们得快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! We've gotta keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.88,1:22:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我 跟紧我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me. Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.65,1:22:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.35,1:22:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须快速行动！跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to move quicker! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.59,1:22:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们拿了我们的雪地摩托 - 快！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They got our snowmobiles. - Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.64,1:22:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.42,1:22:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.92,1:22:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你！让我走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.79,1:22:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.67,1:23:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they going?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.40,1:23:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在乎？快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.21,1:23:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能停一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you stop?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.81,1:23:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丢掉了铁栅栏旁的棍子 我要回去找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dropped the fireplace poker.I gotta go back and find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.51,1:23:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们已经没有时间那样做了 - 这是很好的武器 我们需要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't have time for that.- It's a good weapon. We need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.31,1:23:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和布丽姬特待在一起 - 好吗？我去去就回\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay with Bridget, okay? - I've gotta go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.33,1:23:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.57,1:23:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.40,1:23:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们都从两个方向来的 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're coming in both directions. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.21,1:23:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没看见什么光线 - 他们把这些关掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't see any lights. - They turned them off.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.21,1:23:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺下 藏起来 躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down and hide. Get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.68,1:23:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能这么做 我不能这么做 - 躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't do this. I can't do this. - Get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.55,1:23:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.92,1:23:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,布丽姬特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridget!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.80,1:24:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.57,1:24:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼娅？有多糟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenia? How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.04,1:24:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 好像受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It fucking hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.58,1:24:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 快点 - 他们找到布丽姬特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Come on. - They got Bridget.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.28,1:24:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 让我们去林木线那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's get you to the tree line.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.21,1:24:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我回去找她 好吗？ 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll go back for her, okay? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.04,1:24:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备把你的外套脱下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta get your jacket off.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.51,1:24:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.81,1:24:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样吧 - 准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just do it. - You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.06,1:25:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.63,1:25:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,血应该出的很慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should slow the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.13,1:25:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find her.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.70,1:25:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会一直都待着这儿的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be all right here?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.53,1:25:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一直都在这里的 好么？ - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be right here. Okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.31,1:25:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,布丽姬特！你在哪里？布丽姬特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridget! Where are you, Bridget?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.29,1:25:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持一下！布丽姬特 我来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on! Bridget, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.96,1:26:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.30,1:26:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,布丽姬特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridget?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.38,1:26:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,布丽姬特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridget!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.98,1:26:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,布丽姬特？莎拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridget? Sara?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.55,1:26:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara. Sara.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.56,1:26:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.12,1:26:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！布丽姬特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! Bridget?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.50,1:26:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉！你在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.67,1:27:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.04,1:27:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.72,1:27:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.29,1:27:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,请…救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please… Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.93,1:27:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.53,1:28:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.60,1:28:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.98,1:28:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.65,1:28:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！它启动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! It worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.82,1:28:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.93,1:28:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们离开这个地狱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.40,1:29:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
